  "content": "[Intro]\n[C]\n[G]\n[Cmaj7]\n[G7]\n[C]\nFor you,\n\n[Verse 1]\n[F]\nthere'll be no more\n[C]crying\nFor\n[F]you,\nthe sun will be shining\n[C]\nAnd I feel\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Dm]that when [F]I'm with you\n[Am]It's [G]alright,\n[F]\n[Fmaj7]I know it's\n[C]right\nTo you,\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F]\nI'll give the world\n[C]\nTo\n[F]you,\nI'll never be cold\n[C]\n'Cause I feel\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Dm]that when [F]I'm with you\n[Am]It's [G]alright,\n[F]\n[Fmaj7]I know it's\n[C]right\nAnd the song\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]birds are sing-\n[F]ing Like they know the score\n[Am7]\nAnd I love\n[Fmaj7]you, I love you, I love\n[G7]you Like never before\n[C]\n\n[Intrelude]\n[F]\n[C]\n[F]\n[C]\nAnd I wish\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Dm]you [F]all the love\n[Am]in [G]the world\n[Fmaj7]\nBut\n[G7]most of all, I\nwish it from my\n[C]self\nAnd the song\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]birds keep sing-\n[F]ing Like they know the score\n[Am7]\nAnd I love\n[Fmaj7]you, I love you, I love\n[G7]you Like never before\n[C]\nLike never before\n\n[Outro]\n[C]\n[G]Like never before\n[C]\n[G]\n[C]",
